No, I ain't got no puppy.
Anyway, I'm out of here.

29
00:04:59.333 --> 00:05:01.625
Have fun. Love you.

30
00:05:01.625 --> 00:05:03.375
Love you.

31
00:05:06.042 --> 00:05:07.500
